OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F305A1790016509
OL,3,CQueen of the South suffer joint club
OL,4,Crecord defeat after Highland
OL,5,Chumiliation
OL,7,FQueen of the South have suffered their
OL,8,Fjoint record worst defeat following an
OL,9,F8-0 loss on the road to Ross County on
OL,10,FTuesday evening.
OL,12,FTheir Dingwall disaster leaves them
OL,13,Fsitting bottom of Scottish League One,
OL,14,Fwith just one win recorded after seven
OL,15,Fmatches.
OL,17,FWhere does the result rank in the
OL,18,Fclub's history?
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/4
