OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F305A1790016509
OL,3,CQueen of the South suffer joint club
OL,4,Crecord defeat after Highland
OL,5,Chumiliation
OL,7,FSo far this campaign the Doonahmers
OL,8,Fhave suffered defeats in the league to
OL,9,FEast Kilbride, Peterhead, Alloa
OL,10,FAthletic, Montrose, and Ross County.
OL,12,FThe result has left many Queen of the
OL,13,FSouth fans questioning their start to
OL,14,Fthe season, especially after their
OL,15,FScottish Championship play-off final
OL,16,Fdefeat on penalties to Stenhousemuir
OL,17,Fat the end of last season.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/4
