OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F305A1790016509
OL,3,CQueen of the South suffer joint club
OL,4,Crecord defeat after Highland
OL,5,Chumiliation
OL,7,FIn that penalty shootout Queen of the
OL,8,FSouth had the advantage at one stage
OL,9,Fand looked destined for promotion. A
OL,10,FReece Lyon slip and a Nicky Clark miss
OL,11,Fsaw the Warriors though rise to the
OL,12,FChampionship.
OL,14,FThe contrast between the two clubs
OL,15,Fcould not be any more stark. As Queens
OL,16,Flanguish at the bottom of the third
OL,17,Ftier Stenhousemuir at flying at the
OL,18,Ftop of the second.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/4
